pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# livery-package check (SPEC-livery-package criterion 7): buy car 3001 in the Autoshow for credits and
# drive it in free roam.
# Seed: a render seed of the .local/preview save (it spawns at Dak's Garage with enough credits) with the
# car installed by `tools/manage-fh1-dlc.py install-livery --recipe config\livery-cars\tests\challenger-test.json
# --state-root <seed> --game-root .local\game\eur-base`. The route presses A again at frames 1000-1300, which
# a modded profile needs and an unmodded one ignores.
# The native DLC trace logs the title's entitlement and rows for car 3001 and the stock car:
# dlc-car-trace
# dlc-car-ids 3001,1557
# Route: pause, MAP, the cursor nudged onto the Autoshow, Y fast travel, A; X enters the Autoshow; right
# 14 times to Dodge (the carousel order with the 16 EU packages installed), A; right 4 times to car 3001,
# listed after the stock Challenger, A: the showroom.
# A: BUY; A: buy with credits; the title saves (waits for the garage thumbnail it renders, a .xdc in
# the profile); A at the "return to free roam" prompt (pressed three times; the later presses are a
# brake tap). The run's .state folder is the reload route's seed.
# In free roam the throttle is held until the car has moved 15 m, then the camera turns to each side
# (drive-rear, look-right, look-left, look-back).
